{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301301","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301301","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1830130101:1":{"text":"商会の下に爆弾でも埋まってたのかしら……建物が吹っ飛ぶほどの爆発って、どういうことよ！","source_cn":"商会楼下是埋了颗炸弹吗，为什么会突然爆炸？整栋大楼都塌了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF418D578375F82D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830130102:1":{"text":"そんなの知るかよ……とにかく、逃げ切れてよかった。まだグレイヴボーンにはなりたくないからな！","source_cn":"管他呢……反正咱们逃出来了！我可还不想变成亡灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17449ABBD3301CAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830130103:1":{"text":"明日も仕事に行くの？","source_cn":"那明天还上班吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC9C58222B6740F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830130104:1":{"text":"仕事って、どこへ行くんだよ？もう働く場所なんてないだろ。","source_cn":"上什么班？工位都没了，你还要去哪上班？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x641B296D21650035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830130105:1":{"text":"最高！その言葉を待ってたの！マスター、もう一杯！","source_cn":"太棒了！我等的就是这句话！老板，再来一杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x764F161E59F450D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1830130106:1":{"text":"よし！俺たちの有給休暇に乾杯だ！","source_cn":"来！庆祝我们带薪休假！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2113D0547891B595","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:菲比":{"text":"フィービー","source":"菲比","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥布里":{"text":"オーブリー","source":"奥布里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}